OL,3,GNEWSALongest serving magistrate retires
OL,4,Aafter 49 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe longest-serving magistrate in
OL,7,FEngland and Wales has retired after 49
OL,8,Fyears of service.
OL,10,FBrian Goodhead, 75, was recruited to
OL,11,Fthe bench when he was just 25 and has
OL,12,Fwitnessed huge change to the judicial
OL,13,Fsystem as well as dealing with
OL,14,Fcountless cases.
OL,16,FSpeaking to BBC North West Tonight,
OL,17,FGoodhead, from Preston, shared his
OL,18,Fexperiences to encourage others to
OL,19,Fthink about becoming magistrates. It
OL,20,Fcoincides with a Ministry of Justice
OL,21,F(MoJ) campaign to urge people from all
OL,22,Fbackgrounds to consider signing up.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
