OL,3,GNEWSALongest serving magistrate retires
OL,4,Aafter 49 years
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Being a magistrate is about common
OL,7,Fsense, a bit of empathy, an
OL,8,Funderstanding of the real world and the
OL,9,Fpatience to listen," Goodhead said.
